       alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions TikTok Page\"\n                /></a>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n                <p\n                  style=\"\n                    font-size: 16px;\n                    color: #fff;\n                    font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                  \"\n                >\n                  <small>\n                    Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                    Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                    Philippines 4000<br />\n                    <br />\n                    You are receiving this email because you opted in at our\n                    website. <br />\n                  </small>\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>\n', 1, 'e3ae42c21f0eeb2e8a4f87fdab950bb8370ec54a678365337fe49616ef6ce385', 'Louren Isobel', 'developer', 'Louren Isobel', 'developer', '', '', '', '2025-06-11 14:39:55', '2025-06-13 07:33:57'),
(52, 1, 17, 'louren.rubico@frontlinebusiness.com.ph', 'This is test email June 11 - 3:34pm', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n    <!--Dark Mode meta tags needed to enable Dark Mode in email client user agents-->\n    <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\" />\n    <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark only\" />\n    <title>HRIS and OPS Free Webinar</title>\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n      }\n      @import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;700&display=swap\");\n\n      /* Fallback for email clients that don\'t support @import */\n      @font-face {\n        font-family: \"Poppins\";\n        font-style: normal;\n        font-weight: 400;\n        src: local(\"Poppins Regular\"), local(\"Poppins-Regular\"),\n          url(\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/poppins/v20/pxiEyp8kv8JHgFVrJJfedw.ttf\")\n            format(\"truetype\");\n      }\n      @font-face {\n        font-family: \"Poppins\";\n        font-style: normal;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        src: local(\"Poppins Bold\"), local(\"Poppins-Bold\"),\n          url(\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/poppins/v20/pxiByp8kv8JHgFVrLCz7Z1xlEA.ttf\")\n            format(\"truetype\");\n      }\n      * {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n      }\n      body {\n        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n        color: #333;\n        overflow-x: hidden;\n        background-color: #ffffff;\n      }\n      .canvas {\n        width: 700px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        background-color: #ffffff;\n      }\n\n      @media screen and (min-width: 340px) and (max-width: 520px) {\n        .canvas {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          background-color: white !important;\n        }\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div style=\"background-color: #ffffff !important; width: 100% !important\">\n      <div style=\"background-color: #dddddd !important; padding: 0\">\n        <div\n          style=\"\n            max-width: 700px;\n            width: 100% !important;\n            margin: 0 auto !important;\n            padding: 0 !important;\n            background-color: #ffffff !important;\n          \"\n        >\n          <div class=\"canvas\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff !important\">\n            <!-- BANNER/HERO IMAGE -->\n            <div>\n              <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none; cursor: none\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1IOy07xvIub4XW1FC7oLaibqQdyklDNbI\"\n                  alt=\"Dear Participant, We are writing to extend our heartfelt gratitude for making time\n                to attend our online webinar,\"\n                  style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\"\n              /></a>\n            </div>\n            <!-- INTRODUCTION -->\n            <div style=\"padding: 32px 48px\">\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  margin-bottom: 20px;\n                  font-size: 16px;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                \"\n              >\n                Dear Participant,\n              </p>\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  margin-bottom: 20px;\n                  font-size: 16px;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                \"\n              >\n                We are writing to extend our heartfelt gratitude for making time\n                to attend our online webinar,\n                <span\n                  style=\"\n                    font-weight: bold;\n                    font-size: 16px;\n                    font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                  \"\n                  >\"HRIS and Payroll Webinar.\"\n                </span>\n                It was a pleasure having you with us, and we hope the session\n                provided you with valuable insights that will support your\n                professional and business goals.\n              </p>\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  margin-bottom: 20px;\n                  font-size: 16px;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                \"\n              >\n                As a token of appreciation and to formally acknowledge your\n                participation, we are pleased to attach your\n                <span\n                  style=\"\n                    font-weight: bold;\n                    font-size: 16px;\n                    font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                  \"\n                  >Certificate of Attendance.</span\n                >\n                This certificate confirms your attendance and engagement in the\n                webinar held on June 10, 2025, which covered key topics related\n                to Human Resource Information Systems and Payroll Management.\n              </p>\n              <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 40px 0\">\n                <a\n                  target=\"_blank\"\n                  class=\"btn\"\n                  href=\"#\"\n                  style=\"\n                    display: inline-block;\n                    color: #ffffff;\n                    font-weight: 900;\n                    padding: 14px 25px;\n                    background-color: #a00175;\n                    border-radius: 15px;\n                    text-decoration: none;\n                    font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2),\n                      0 6px 20px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.19);\n                    font-size: 16px;\n                  \"\n                  >Download Certificate</a\n                >\n              </div>\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  margin-bottom: 5px;\n                  font-size: 16px;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                  font-weight: bold;\n                \"\n              >\n                What\'s next?\n              </p>\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  font-size: 16px;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                \"\n              >\n                If you’re ready to streamline your HR and payroll processes,\n                we’d love to help you get started. Our system is built to\n                simplify your day-to-day tasks, ensure compliance, and give your\n                team more time to focus on what truly matters.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n            <!-- CONSULTATION -->\n            <div\n              style=\"\n                padding: 48px;\n                background-color: #ffcc00 !important;\n                mso-color-alt: #ffcc00 !important;\n              \"\n            >\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  font-weight: bold;\n                  color: #a00175;\n                  max-width: 423px !important;\n                  width: 100% !important;\n                  margin: 0 auto;\n                  text-align: center;\n                  margin-bottom: 20px;\n                  font-size: 16px;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                \"\n              >\n                Book a Free Consultation to Explore How Our System Can Meet Your Unique Needs.\n              </p>\n\n              <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px\">\n                <a\n                  target=\"_blank\"\n                  class=\"btn\"\n                  href=\"https://calendly.com/frontlinebusiness-marketing/30min\"\n                  style=\"\n                    display: inline-block;\n                    color: #ffffff;\n                    font-weight: 900;\n                    padding: 14px 25px;\n                    background-color: #a00175;\n                    border-radius: 15px;\n                    text-decoration: none;\n                    font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2),\n                      0 6px 20px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.19);\n                    font-size: 16px;\n                  \"\n                  >Contact Us</a\n                >\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- FREE TRIAL -->\n            <div\n              style=\"\n                padding: 48px;\n                background-color: #efefef !important;\n                mso-color-alt: #efefef !important;\n              \"\n            >\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  font-weight: bold;\n                  color: #a00175;\n                  text-align: center;\n                  margin-bottom: 20px;\n                  font-size: 16px;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                \"\n              >\n                Experience Efficiency Streamlining Your Process in Just Clicks! Try Our Web Application for Free!\n              </p>\n              \n              <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px\">\n                <a\n                  target=\"_blank\"\n                  class=\"btn\"\n                  href=\"https://calendly.com/frontlinebusiness-marketing/30min\"\n                  style=\"\n                    display: inline-block;\n                    color: #ffffff;\n                    font-weight: 900;\n                    padding: 14px 25px;\n                    background-color: #a00175;\n                    border-radius: 15px;\n                    text-decoration: none;\n                    font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2),\n                      0 6px 20px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.19);\n                    font-size: 16px;\n                  \"\n                  >Get FREE 7-Days Trial</a\n                >\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- CONTACT -->\n            <div class=\"contactMobile\" style=\"padding: 32px 48px\">\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  margin-bottom: 20px;\n                  font-size: 16px;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                \"\n              >\n                If you have any questions or would like to know more about our\n                solution, feel free to reply to this email. We’re here to\n                support you!\n              </p>\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  margin-bottom: 60px;\n                  font-size: 16px;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                \"\n              >\n                Warm regards,\n              </p>\n              <table style=\"margin: 0 auto !important\" class=\"contact-mobile\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"display: block\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none; cursor: none\">\n                      <img\n                        style=\"\n                          width: 100%;\n                          max-width: 80px;\n                          display: block;\n                          margin: 0 auto;\n                        \"\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNwbQuBMk5tk4sfEm6VpS_hHUtX2YqJfo1lexFxVQyMRSdZw7haeU3hnKl3SZobWFAGS6QlDM_EHqI4lwrrSa5yp3qFouXtcXUbU2r8jq9wd1jVvLU=s116-p-k\"\n                        alt=\"sir-carlo\"\n                      />\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                  <td\n                    style=\"\n                      line-height: 1.2 !important;\n                      text-align: center !important;\n                      display: block;\n                    \"\n                  >\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 10px\">\n                      <p\n                        style=\"\n                          font-size: 16px;\n                          margin: 0;\n                          font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                        \"\n                      >\n                        Carlo Del Monte\n                      </p>\n                      <p\n                        style=\"\n                          font-size: 16px;\n                          margin: 0;\n                          font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                        \"\n                      >\n                        Marketing Head\n                      </p>\n                      <p\n                        style=\"\n                          font-size: 12px;\n                          margin: 0;\n                          font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                        \"\n                      >\n                        marketing@frontlinebusiness.com.ph\n                      </p>\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n            <!-- FOOTER -->\n            <div\n              class=\"footer\"\n              style=\"padding: 32px 24px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n            >\n              <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none; cursor: none\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                  alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Logo\"\n                  style=\"\n                    width: 200px;\n                    display: block;\n                    margin-left: auto;\n                    margin-right: auto;\n                  \"\n                />\n              </a>\n              <h3\n                style=\"\n                  color: #fff;\n                  text-align: center;\n                  margin: 16px 0;\n                  line-height: 1.2;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                \"\n              >\n                Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n                in Managed Services\n              </h3>\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  color: #fff;\n                  text-align: center;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                  margin-bottom: 16px;\n                  line-height: 1.2;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                \"\n              >\n                We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n                <br />\n                web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n                development.\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Facebook Page\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions LinkedIn Page\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions YouTube Channel\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontline.business/\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPsABBWthmMwhMnRaz0NxOwLNe_F5dyau9JBbQUAbT48kN5S7WKa1_M6SSb6awE4kFyDiIKv7prYY2wCPNfYegju-Ph0xjM9khTrzBbAb0eY8AUwA=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Instagram Page\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@frontlinebusinessinc\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNF50VT3hd-2PhvM_OUWALWmBgwrHp3drnQM-wGSSP5-C-RHXP-HePnxs4W-f8dDzun14Jth78npNTahLoR-9snETM5vsIPBBvdXzJfqPS8-eYZwiA=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions TikTok Page\"\n                /></a>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n                <p\n                  style=\"\n                    font-size: 16px;\n                    color: #fff;\n                    font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                  \"\n                >\n                  <small>\n                    Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                    Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                    Philippines 4000<br />\n                    <br />\n                    You are receiving this email because you opted in at our\n                    website. <br />\n                  </small>\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>\n', 1, '3a34b34341be96bcb31dfe6ad1b14510949ffc9c561bb8d3cafbc7ed503e7fdd', 'Louren Isobel', 'developer', 'Louren Isobel', 'developer', '11', 'louren.rubico@frontlinebusiness.com.ph', '', '2025-06-11 15:34:54', '2025-06-13 07:34:22');
