  >\n                Let\'s talk about your specific HR/payroll challenges and how we\n                can help you automate, simplify, and grow with confidence.\n              </p>\n              <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px\">\n                <a\n                  target=\"_blank\"\n                  class=\"btn\"\n                  href=\"https://calendly.com/frontlinebusiness-marketing/30min\"\n                  style=\"\n                    display: inline-block;\n                    color: #ffffff;\n                    font-weight: 900;\n                    padding: 14px 25px;\n                    background-color: #a00175;\n                    border-radius: 15px;\n                    text-decoration: none;\n                    font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2),\n                      0 6px 20px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.19);\n                    font-size: 16px;\n                  \"\n                  >Book A 1-on-1 Demo</a\n                >\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- CONTACT -->\n            <div class=\"contactMobile\" style=\"padding: 32px 48px\">\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  margin-bottom: 20px;\n                  font-size: 16px;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                \"\n              >\n                You\'ve taken the first step—let\'s keep the momentum going.\n              </p>\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  margin-bottom: 20px;\n                  font-size: 16px;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                \"\n              >\n                Looking forward to hearing from you soon!\n              </p>\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  margin-bottom: 60px;\n                  font-size: 16px;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n                \"\n              >\n                Blessings,\n              </p>\n              <table style=\"margin: 0 auto !important\" class=\"contact-mobile\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"display: block\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none; cursor: none\">\n                      <img\n                        style=\"\n                          width: 100%;\n                          max-width: 80px;\n                          display: block;\n                          margin: 0 auto;\n                        \"\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNwbQuBMk5tk4sfEm6VpS_hHUtX2YqJfo1lexFxVQyMRSdZw7haeU3hnKl3SZobWFAGS6QlDM_EHqI4lwrrSa5yp3qFouXtcXUbU2r8jq9wd1jVvLU=s116-p-k\"\n                        alt=\"sir-carlo\"\n                      />\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                  <td\n                    style=\"\n                      line-height: 1.2 !important;\n                      text-align: center !important;\n                      display: block;\n                    \"\n                  >\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 10px\">\n                      <p\n                        style=\"\n                          font-size: 16px;\n                          margin: 0;\n                          font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                        \"\n                      >\n                        Carlo Del Monte\n                      </p>\n                      <p\n                        style=\"\n                          font-size: 16px;\n                          margin: 0;\n                          font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                        \"\n                      >\n                        Marketing Head\n                      </p>\n                      <p\n                        style=\"\n                          font-size: 12px;\n                          margin: 0;\n                          font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                        \"\n                      >\n                        marketing@frontlinebusiness.com.ph\n                      </p>\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n            <!-- FOOTER -->\n            <div\n              class=\"footer\"\n              style=\"padding: 32px 24px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n            >\n              <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none; cursor: none\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                  alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Logo\"\n                  style=\"\n                    width: 200px;\n                    display: block;\n                    margin-left: auto;\n                    margin-right: auto;\n                  \"\n                />\n              </a>\n              <h3\n                style=\"\n                  color: #fff;\n                  text-align: center;\n                  margin: 16px 0;\n                  line-height: 1.2;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                \"\n              >\n                Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n                in Managed Services\n              </h3>\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  color: #fff;\n                  text-align: center;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                  margin-bottom: 16px;\n                  line-height: 1.2;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                \"\n              >\n                We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n                <br />\n                web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n                development.\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Facebook Page\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions LinkedIn Page\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions YouTube Channel\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontline.business/\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPsABBWthmMwhMnRaz0NxOwLNe_F5dyau9JBbQUAbT48kN5S7WKa1_M6SSb6awE4kFyDiIKv7prYY2wCPNfYegju-Ph0xjM9khTrzBbAb0eY8AUwA=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Instagram Page\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@frontlinebusinessinc\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNF50VT3hd-2PhvM_OUWALWmBgwrHp3drnQM-wGSSP5-C-RHXP-HePnxs4W-f8dDzun14Jth78npNTahLoR-9snETM5vsIPBBvdXzJfqPS8-eYZwiA=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions TikTok Page\"\n                /></a>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n                <p\n                  style=\"\n                    font-size: 16px;\n                    color: #fff;\n                    font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                  \"\n                >\n                  <small>\n                    Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                    Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                    Philippines 4000<br />\n                    <br />\n                    You are receiving this email because you opted in at our\n                    website. <br />\n                  </small>\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>', 1, 'b266a20d5602c105209910b3156afed0a785a41276f9982585c22ad8ffd47b38', 'Louren Isobel', 'developer', '', '', '', '', '', '2025-06-13 07:38:24', '0000-00-00 00:00:00');
INSERT INTO `fbsv2_sending_email_log` (`sending_email_log_aid`, `sending_email_log_is_active`, `sending_email_log_audience_id`, `sending_email_log_email`, `sending_email_log_subject`, `sending_email_log_content`, `sending_email_log_is_success`, `sending_email_log_key`, `sending_email_log_firstname`, `sending_email_log_role`, `sending_email_log_firstname_resend`, `sending_email_log_role_resend`, `sending_email_log_reply_to_id`, `sending_email_log_reply_to`, `sending_email_log_file`, `sending_email_log_created`, `sending_email_log_datetime`) VALUES
(55, 1, 17, 'lourenisobel18@gmail.com', 'FBS Newsletter: May 2025 rrr', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <!--Dark Mode meta tags needed to enable Dark Mode in email client user agents-->\n    <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\" />\n    <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark only\" />\n    <title>HRIS and OPS Free Webinar</title>\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n      }\n      @import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;700&display=swap\");\n\n      * {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n      }\n      body {\n        font-family: \"Montserrat\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n        color: #333;\n        overflow-x: hidden;\n      }\n      img {\n        pointer-events: none !important;\n      }\n      p,\n      ul li {\n        font-size: 14px;\n      }\n      h3 {\n        line-height: 30px;\n      }\n      .canvas {\n        width: 700px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        background-color: white;\n      }\n      table {\n        border-spacing: 0;\n      }\n      table td {\n        vertical-align: middle;\n      }\n      .responsive-table {\n        margin: 0 auto;\n      }\n      .responsive-table td {\n        vertical-align: middle;\n      }\n      .responsive-table .text-content {\n        text-align: left;\n        margin-left: 20px;\n      }\n      .hide-button {\n        display: block;\n      }\n      .hidden-button-mobile {\n        display: none;\n      }\n\n      @media screen and (min-width: 340px) and (max-width: 520px) {\n        #contact-email {\n          font-size: 12px !important;\n        }\n        .hide-button {\n          display: none;\n        }\n        .hidden-button-mobile {\n          display: block;\n        }\n        table td {\n          vertical-align: top !important;\n        }\n        .canvas {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          background-color: white !important;\n        }\n        .container {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          padding: 0 !important;\n          margin: 0 auto !important;\n        }\n        .seminar {\n          padding: 0 !important;\n        }\n        .responsive-table td {\n          display: block;\n          /* text-align: center !important; */\n          padding-left: 0 !important;\n          padding-right: 0 !important;\n          width: 100% !important;\n        }\n        .responsive-table p {\n          max-width: 100% !important;\n        }\n        .responsive-table .text-content {\n          margin-left: 0;\n          text-align: center !important;\n        }\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <section class=\"seminar\" style=\"background-color: #ddd; padding: 0\">\n      <div\n        class=\"container\"\n        style=\"width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: white\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"canvas\">\n          <!-- BANNER/HERO IMAGE -->\n          <div>\n            <img\n              src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/17Wd4CgXxwK7HIceupCxgkdh5AP3oC2y6\"\n              alt=\"hero-img\"\n              style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\"\n            />\n            <a href=\"#\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1DW5KuTBLaKYRFXdgdzypTJw2j0kNyR_J\"\n                alt=\"hero-img\"\n                style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\"\n            /></a>\n          </div>\n          <!-- INTRODUCTION -->\n          <div style=\"padding: 32px\">\n            <div>\n              <h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; max-width: 488px\">\n                Revolutionize Your Business with HR and Payroll Automation\n              </h3>\n              <span\n                style=\"\n                  font-weight: bold;\n                  color: #d60070;\n                  margin-bottom: 30px;\n                  display: inline-block;\n                \"\n                >Web Applications and Web Services</span\n              >\n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n                Managing human resources and payroll manually can be\n                time-consuming, error-prone, and inefficient. In today\'s fast\n                paced digital landscape,businesses need to adapt smart solutions\n                that streamline operations and reduce administrative burdens.\n              </p>\n              <div>\n                <p\n                  style=\"\n                    font-weight: bold;\n                    text-transform: uppercase;\n                    margin-bottom: 10px;\n                    text-align: center;\n                  \"\n                >\n                  FREE HR AND PAYROLL AUTOMATION WEBINAR\n                </p>\n                <div style=\"width: fit-content; margin: 0 auto\">\n                  <p>June 10,2025, Tuesday</p>\n                  <p>2:00 PM to 3:00 PM</p>\n                  <p>Via Zoom</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\">\n                <a\n                  class=\"btn\"\n                  target=\"_blank\"\n                  href=\"https://share.hsforms.com/1_6gwfLp7R6au2gOl7OQ1dA5hs41\"\n                  style=\"\n                    display: inline-block;\n                    color: #ffffff;\n                    padding: 12px 50px;\n                    background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                    text-decoration: none;\n                    box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                    font-size: 10px;\n                    text-transform: uppercase;\n                    border-radius: 5px;\n                  \"\n                  >Register Now!</a\n                >\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"padding: 32px; background-color: #fef7ed\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; max-width: 633px\">\n              Completion of Our Full-Stack Development and Accounting Associate\n              Interns\n            </h3>\n            <span\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: bold;\n                color: #d60070;\n                margin-bottom: 30px;\n                display: inline-block;\n              \"\n              >Learning Center Solutions Service</span\n            >\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n              We proudly recognize and celebrate the successful completion of\n              the on-the-job training (OJT) of our full-stack development\n              interns from STI College San Pablo, Laguna State Polytechnic\n              University - San Pablo City Campus, and De La Salle University -\n              Lipa.\n            </p>\n            <table class=\"responsive-table\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding-right: 15px; padding-bottom: 30px\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/16hux-PYAgR_tNpT7gX_w8YiMhNslg8Wv\"\n                    alt=\"dela-salle-lipa\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"padding-left: 15px; padding-bottom: 30px\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1o-V2686McQWM6Q_9AiV1Mx8CvMy2u4Wi\"\n                    alt=\"dela-salle-lipa\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding-right: 15px; padding-bottom: 30px\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1SoBScQIP3tfbLxUZxfhMw-6DyyDiVQBW\"\n                    alt=\"dela-salle-lipa\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"padding-left: 15px; padding-bottom: 30px\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1n0MRSBmLhsTxj5tcRMpw0M-2wqLJ_IUT\"\n                    alt=\"dela-salle-lipa\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding-right: 15px; padding-bottom: 30px\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1YormB7BnFeGw3xu_tQRWbYUFbk-4R5Nw\"\n                    alt=\"dela-salle-lipa\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"padding-left: 15px; padding-bottom: 30px\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1Z9Wy7fUk_6EF170xjcNZJ0n6KzvbbET5\"\n                    alt=\"dela-salle-lipa\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\">\n              <a\n                target=\"_blank\"\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/celebrating-ojt-completion\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #ffffff;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                  font-size: 10px;\n                  text-transform: uppercase;\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                \"\n                >read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"padding: 32px; background-color: #f7f7f7\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold\">\n              Leadership Seminar with Mr. Robert Han\n            </h3>\n            <span\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: bold;\n                color: #d60070;\n                margin-bottom: 30px;\n                display: inline-block;\n              \"\n              >Employees Training and Development</span\n            >\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n              On May 2, 2025, the Supervisors of Frontline Business Solutions,\n              Inc. were privileged to attend a transformative leadership seminar\n              conducted by one of our esteemed business partners, Sir Robert\n              Han. The session was more than a typical leadership training—it\n              was a compelling call to lead with integrity, purpose, and faith,\n              challenging each leader to reflect on their values and how they\n              lead in both life and work.\n            </p>\n            <img\n              src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1MsMGN297O7luRXDFY70ThUtkSELcsrkV\"\n              alt=\"hero-img\"\n              style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\"\n            />\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                target=\"_blank\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/empowering-leaders-with-purpose\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #ffffff;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                  font-size: 10px;\n                  text-transform: uppercase;\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                \"\n                >read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"padding: 32px; background-color: #fef7ed\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; max-width: 486px\">\n              FBS Joins STI College San Pablo\'s 2025 National Career Fest\n            </h3>\n            <span\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: bold;\n                color: #d60070;\n                margin-bottom: 30px;\n                display: inline-block;\n              \"\n              >Client Partnership and Network</span\n            >\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n              Frontline Business Solutions proudly participated in the 2025\n              National Career Fest hosted by STI College San Pablo last May 23,\n              2025. As a long-time partner of the school in its College\n              On-The-Job Training (OJT) and Senior High School Work Immersion\n              programs, our presence at the event reaffirmed our commitment to\n              supporting the school\'s annual initiatives that equip students\n              with real-world career exposure.\n            </p>\n            <img\n              src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1mA7MvAIDsQrMaz4vryRAKS1bgshY5Qym\"\n              alt=\"hero-img\"\n              style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\"\n            />\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                target=\"_blank\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/sti-national-career-fest\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #ffffff;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                  font-size: 10px;\n                  text-transform: uppercase;\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                \"\n                >read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"padding: 32px; background-color: #f7f7f7\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; max-width: 466px\">\n              Empowering Creatives Through Psychology-Driven Design\n            </h3>\n            <span\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: bold;\n                color: #d60070;\n                margin-bottom: 30px;\n                display: inline-block;\n              \"\n              >Employees Training and Development</span\n            >\n\n            <table class=\"responsive-table\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n                  <p style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 304px; margin-bottom: 30px\">\n                    The Learning Center Solutions department of FBS recently\n                    hosted an insightful seminar titled \"Psychology in UI/UX for\n                    Graphic Design,\" aimed at enhancing the design skills of our\n                    Virtual Assistants (VAs) and Marketing staff. The session,\n                    also joined by interested employees from other departments\n                    across Frontline Business Solutions and the wider Frontline\n                    Group of Companies, was a part of our continuous efforts to\n                    invest in our people and elevate the quality of digital\n                    assets we produce.\n                  </p>\n                  <div\n                    class=\"hide-button\"\n                    style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\"\n                  >\n                    <a\n                      class=\"btn\"\n                      target=\"_blank\"\n                      href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/empowering-creatives\"\n                      style=\"\n                        display: inline-block;\n                        color: #ffffff;\n                        padding: 12px 50px;\n                        background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                        text-decoration: none;\n                        box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                        font-size: 10px;\n                        text-transform: uppercase;\n                        border-radius: 5px;\n                      \"\n                      >read more</a\n                    >\n                  </div>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"width: 50%; vertical-align: top\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1gR4mTJAqKzq12poDqx6vtUVRkpbsaFS5\"\n                    alt=\"psychology in ui/ux for graphic design\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n            <div\n              class=\"hidden-button-mobile\"\n              style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\"\n            >\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                target=\"_blank\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/empowering-creatives\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #ffffff;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                  font-size: 10px;\n                  text-transform: uppercase;\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                \"\n                >read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"padding: 32px; background-color: #fef7ed\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; max-width: 493px\">\n              FBS Celebrates Its 7th Year with a PBB-Themed Fellowship\n            </h3>\n            <span\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: bold;\n                color: #d60070;\n                margin-bottom: 30px;\n                display: inline-block;\n              \"\n              >Company Culture and Team Building</span\n            >\n\n            <table class=\"responsive-table\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"width: 50%; vertical-align: top\">\n                  <p style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 304px; margin-bottom: 30px\">\n                    This May, Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. turned its\n                    monthly company fellowship into a festive and meaningful\n                    celebration, marked not just by milestones, but by\n                    camaraderie, creativity, and connection. Staying true to\n                    this year\'s theme, \"Raising the Bar, Reaching Far,\" the\n                    event took on a unique twist with a Pinoy Big Brother\n                    (PBB)-inspired concept—turning employees into housemates for\n                    a day filled with fun, games, and team spirit.\n                  </p>\n                  <div\n                    class=\"hide-button\"\n                    style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\"\n                  >\n                    <a\n                      class=\"btn\"\n                      target=\"_blank\"\n                      href=\"#\"\n                      style=\"\n                        display: inline-block;\n                        color: #ffffff;\n                        padding: 12px 50px;\n                        background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                        text-decoration: none;\n                        box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                        font-size: 10px;\n                        text-transform: uppercase;\n                        border-radius: 5px;\n                      \"\n                      >read more</a\n                    >\n                  </div>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"width: 50%; vertical-align: top\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1mhgPwNDhZlbGJsuF2y3_lA_H8QVeJRRA\"\n                    alt=\"pinoy big brother\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n            <div\n              class=\"hidden-button-mobile\"\n              style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\"\n            >\n              <a\n                target=\"_blank\"\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #ffffff;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                  font-size: 10px;\n                  text-transform: uppercase;\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                \"\n                >read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FOOTER -->\n          <div\n            class=\"footer\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 24px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n          >\n            <a href=\"\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 200px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <h3 style=\"color: #fff; text-align: center; margin: 16px 0\">\n              Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n              in Managed Services\n            </h3>\n            <p\n              style=\"\n                color: #fff;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: 12px;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n              \"\n            >\n              We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n              <br />\n              web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n              development.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontline.business/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPsABBWthmMwhMnRaz0NxOwLNe_F5dyau9JBbQUAbT48kN5S7WKa1_M6SSb6awE4kFyDiIKv7prYY2wCPNfYegju-Ph0xjM9khTrzBbAb0eY8AUwA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@frontlinebusinessinc\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNF50VT3hd-2PhvM_OUWALWmBgwrHp3drnQM-wGSSP5-C-RHXP-HePnxs4W-f8dDzun14Jth78npNTahLoR-9snETM5vsIPBBvdXzJfqPS8-eYZwiA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #fff\">\n                <small>\n                  Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                  Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                  Philippines 4000<br />\n                  <br />\n                  You are receiving this email because you opted in at our\n                  website. <br />\n                </small>\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>\n', 1, 'e3ae42c21f0eeb2e8a4f87fdab950bb8370ec54a678365337fe49616ef6ce385', 'Louren Isobel', 'developer', '', '', '11', 'louren.rubico@frontlinebusiness.com.ph', '', '2025-06-13 07:39:44', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(56, 1, 13, 'john_hey_16@yahoo.com', 'This is test email June 23', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\" />\n    <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark only\" />\n    <title>The Responsible Use of AI in Teaching and Learning</title>\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n      }\n      * {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n      }\n      body {\n        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n        color: #333;\n        overflow-x: hidden;\n      }\n      p,\n      ul li {\n        font-size: 18px;\n      }\n      .canvas {\n        width: 700px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n      }\n      table {\n        border-spacing: 0;\n      }\n      .seminar-block {\n        padding: 48px;\n      }\n      @media screen and (min-width: 340px) and (max-width: 520px) {\n        .canvas {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          background-color: #f9f9f9 !important;\n        }\n        .container {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          padding: 0 !important;\n          margin: 0 auto !important;\n        }\n        .seminar {\n          padding: 0 !important;\n        }\n        h2 {\n          font-size: 20px !important;\n        }\n        p,\n        ul li {\n          font-size: 14px !important;\n        }\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <section class=\"seminar\" style=\"background-color: #f2f2f2; padding: 0\">\n      <div\n        class=\"container\"\n        style=\"width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: white\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"canvas\">\n          <!-- BANNER  -->\n          <div>\n            <a href=\"#\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1N82sIbzgBMiOXterreXQNeABwFEaZEhf\"\n                alt=\"The Responsible Use of AI in Teaching and Learning\"\n                style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\"\n            /></a>\n          </div>\n          <!-- CONTENT -->\n          <div class=\"seminar-block\" style=\"background-color: white\">\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">Dear Participant,</p>\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\n              Thank you for joining us for the\n              <b\n                >Face-to-Face Seminar in The Responsible Use of AI in Learning\n                and Teaching\n              </b>\n              .\n            </p>\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\n              We appreciate your active participation and thoughtful\n              contributions throughout the session. We hope you found the\n              seminar valuable and that you now feel more confident in using\n              artificial intelligence in shaping the future of education.\n            </p>\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\n              We’d love to hear your thoughts! Your feedback helps us continue\n              improving our programs and bring you even better learning\n              experiences.\n            </p>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://forms.gle/YNhFj8iVEL6Jfoug6\n                \"\n                style=\"\n                  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: white;\n                  font-weight: 900;\n                  padding: 12px 30px;\n                  background: #8f135e;\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                  font-size: 14px;\n                \"\n                >Share your Feedback!</a\n              >\n            </div>\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\n              Stay connected with us through our social media pages and website\n              for announcements on upcoming training, workshops, and short\n              courses! More exciting sessions like this are on the way—don’t\n              miss out on new learning opportunities!\n            </p>\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\n              Thank you for choosing <b>Frontline Business Solutions</b> as your\n              learning partner. We look forward to seeing you again soon!\n            </p>\n          </div>\n          <!-- footer -->\n          <div\n            class=\"footer\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 24px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n          >\n            <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none; cursor: none\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Logo\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 200px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <h3\n              style=\"\n                color: #fff;\n                text-align: center;\n                margin: 16px 0;\n                line-height: 1.2;\n                font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n              \"\n            >\n              Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n              in Managed Services\n            </h3>\n            <p\n              style=\"\n                color: #fff;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: 12px;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.2;\n                font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n              \"\n            >\n              We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n              <br />\n              web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n              development.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Facebook Page\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions LinkedIn Page\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions YouTube Channel\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontline.business/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPsABBWthmMwhMnRaz0NxOwLNe_F5dyau9JBbQUAbT48kN5S7WKa1_M6SSb6awE4kFyDiIKv7prYY2wCPNfYegju-Ph0xjM9khTrzBbAb0eY8AUwA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Instagram Page\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@frontlinebusinessinc\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNF50VT3hd-2PhvM_OUWALWmBgwrHp3drnQM-wGSSP5-C-RHXP-HePnxs4W-f8dDzun14Jth78npNTahLoR-9snETM5vsIPBBvdXzJfqPS8-eYZwiA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions TikTok Page\"\n              /></a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  font-size: 16px;\n                  color: #fff;\n                  font-family: \'Poppins\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n                \"\n              >\n                <small>\n                  Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                  Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                  Philippines 4000<br />\n                  <br />\n                  You are receiving this email because you opted in at our\n                  website. <br />\n                </small>\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>', 1, '298a7f57c2a5889a8c576764a70c53cb01f750c180f6fb46c962585221028d05', 'Louren Isobel', 'developer', '', '', '8', 'lourenisobel18@gmail.com', '', '2025-06-23 15:58:14', '0000-00-00 00:00:00');
INSERT INTO `fbsv2_sending_email_log` (`sending_email_log_aid`, `sending_email_log_is_active`, `sending_email_log_audience_id`, `sending_email_log_email`, `sending_email_log_subject`, `sending_email_log_content`, `sending_email_log_is_success`, `sending_email_log_key`, `sending_email_log_firstname`, `sending_email_log_role`, `sending_email_log_firstname_resend`, `sending_email_log_role_resend`, `sending_email_log_reply_to_id`, `sending_email_log_reply_to`, `sending_email_log_file`, `sending_email_log_created`, `sending_email_log_datetime`) VALUES
(57, 1, 17, 'louren.rubico@frontlinebusiness.com.ph', 'Test: Promotional Newsletter', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\" />\n    <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark only\" />\n    <title>Project Next Wave</title>\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n      }\n      * {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n      }\n      body {\n        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n        color: #333;\n        overflow-x: hidden;\n        background-color: #ffffff;\n      }\n      p,\n      ul li {\n        font-size: 16px !important;\n      }\n      .canvas {\n        width: 700px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        background-color: #ffffff;\n      }\n      .section-block {\n        padding: 32px !important;\n      }\n      @media screen and (min-width: 340px) and (max-width: 520px) {\n        .canvas {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          background-color: white !important;\n        }\n        p,\n        ul li {\n          font-size: 16px !important;\n        }\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div style=\"background-color: #ffffff !important; width: 100% !important\">\n      <div style=\"background-color: #dddddd !important; padding: 0\">\n        <div\n          style=\"\n            max-width: 700px;\n            width: 100% !important;\n            margin: 0 auto !important;\n            padding: 0 !important;\n            background-color: #ffffff !important;\n          \"\n        >\n          <div class=\"canvas\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff !important\">\n            <!-- BANNER/HERO IMAGE -->\n            <div>\n              <a href=\"#\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1hMzFmxbK6iAO_XjpVgvWC4dtVKz_LBak\"\n                  alt=\"Uncover hidden issues and missed opportunities—at no cost.\"\n                  style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\"\n              /></a>\n            </div>\n            <!-- INTRODUCTION -->\n            <div class=\"section-block\">\n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">Hi there,</p>\n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\n                We had a quick look at your website — and while you\'ve got\n                something great going, we spotted a few red flags that could be\n                holding it back from its full potential.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                Think slow loading times, outdated design elements, or missed\n                SEO opportunities — these small issues might be costing you\n                leads, traffic, or even sales.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n            <!-- OUTLINE -->\n            <div class=\"section-block\" style=\"background-color: #f2f2f2\">\n              <table class=\"table-list\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td>\n                    <img\n                      width=\"40px\"\n                      style=\"display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/123-UWlQXpWuMBtS1tg5e_b_ON-c-l_xL\"\n                      alt=\"Thumbs-up Icon Image\"\n                    />\n                  </td>\n                  <td>\n                    <h3 style=\"color: #ad0a64\">But here\'s the good news:</h3>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n              <p style=\"margin: 20px 0\">\n                We\'re offering you a <strong>FREE Website Audit</strong> — no\n                commitments, just expert insights to help you grow.\n              </p>\n              <p>With our audit, you\'ll discover:</p>\n              <table class=\"table-list\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/13_jZq2Hey6SDjJQGq-MRCs_RNZ93pMgp\"\n                        width=\"16\"\n                        alt=\"Check Icon Image\"\n                        style=\"\n                          display: inline-block;\n                          vertical-align: middle;\n                          margin-right: 10px;\n                        \"\n                      />\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\">\n                    What\'s slowing your site down\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/13_jZq2Hey6SDjJQGq-MRCs_RNZ93pMgp\"\n                        width=\"16\"\n                        alt=\"Check Icon Image\"\n                        style=\"\n                          display: inline-block;\n                          vertical-align: middle;\n                          margin-right: 10px;\n                        \"\n                      />\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\">\n                    Where users might be dropping off\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/13_jZq2Hey6SDjJQGq-MRCs_RNZ93pMgp\"\n                        width=\"16\"\n                        alt=\"Check Icon Image\"\n                        style=\"\n                          display: inline-block;\n                          vertical-align: middle;\n                          margin-right: 10px;\n                        \"\n                      />\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\">\n                    SEO and design improvements that convert\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/13_jZq2Hey6SDjJQGq-MRCs_RNZ93pMgp\"\n                        width=\"16\"\n                        alt=\"Check Icon Image\"\n                        style=\"\n                          display: inline-block;\n                          vertical-align: middle;\n                          margin-right: 10px;\n                        \"\n                      />\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\">\n                    Actionable steps to boost your online performance\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n              <p style=\"margin-top: 20px\">\n                This isn\'t a generic scan — it\'s a personalized, hands-on review\n                from our experienced web team.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n            <!-- SCHEDULE -->\n            <div\n              class=\"schedule\"\n              style=\"\n                background-image: url(\'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1dEXipIH7QkybQZyhL2uPoaFGGL2h_-wv\');\n                background-repeat: no-repeat;\n                background-size: cover;\n                background-position: center;\n                height: fit-content;\n                border: none;\n                padding: 48px;\n              \"\n            >\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  margin: 0px auto 40px;\n                  text-align: center;\n                  color: #fff6fb;\n                  max-width: 430px;\n                \"\n              >\n                Let us show you what your website is truly capable of.\n              </p>\n              <div style=\"text-align: center\">\n                <a\n                  class=\"btn\"\n                  href=\"#\"\n                  style=\"\n                    display: inline-block;\n                    color: #dbd5d5;\n                    font-weight: 300;\n                    padding: 15px 20px;\n                    background-color: #f5c400;\n                    color: #ad0a64;\n                    border-radius: 5px;\n                    text-decoration: none;\n                    font-size: 18px;\n                    font-weight: 600;\n                  \"\n                  >Claim Your FREE Audit</a\n                >\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- CONTACT -->\n            <div class=\"section-block\">\n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\n                We\'d love to support your digital growth!\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">Best regards,</p>\n\n              <div class=\"contact\" style=\"text-align: center\">\n                <a href=\"#\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNwbQuBMk5tk4sfEm6VpS_hHUtX2YqJfo1lexFxVQyMRSdZw7haeU3hnKl3SZobWFAGS6QlDM_EHqI4lwrrSa5yp3qFouXtcXUbU2r8jq9wd1jVvLU=s116-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"sir-carlo\"\n                    style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; width: 70px\"\n                  />\n                </a>\n                <div>\n                  <p style=\"font-weight: 600\">Carlo Del Monte</p>\n                  <p>Marketing Head</p>\n                  <p style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #333\">\n                    marketing@frontlinebusiness.com.ph\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- FOOTER -->\n            <div\n              class=\"footer\"\n              style=\"padding: 32px 24px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n            >\n              <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none; cursor: none\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                  alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Logo\"\n                  style=\"\n                    width: 200px;\n                    display: block;\n                    margin-left: auto;\n                    margin-right: auto;\n                  \"\n                />\n              </a>\n              <h3\n                style=\"\n                  color: #fff;\n                  text-align: center;\n                  margin: 16px 0;\n                  line-height: 1.2;\n                \"\n              >\n                Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n                in Managed Services\n              </h3>\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  color: #fff;\n                  text-align: center;\n                  font-size: 12px !important;\n                  margin-bottom: 16px;\n                  line-height: 1.2;\n                \"\n              >\n                We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n                <br />\n                web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n                development.\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Facebook Page\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions LinkedIn Page\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions YouTube Channel\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontline.business/\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPsABBWthmMwhMnRaz0NxOwLNe_F5dyau9JBbQUAbT48kN5S7WKa1_M6SSb6awE4kFyDiIKv7prYY2wCPNfYegju-Ph0xjM9khTrzBbAb0eY8AUwA=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Instagram Page\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@frontlinebusinessinc\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNF50VT3hd-2PhvM_OUWALWmBgwrHp3drnQM-wGSSP5-C-RHXP-HePnxs4W-f8dDzun14Jth78npNTahLoR-9snETM5vsIPBBvdXzJfqPS8-eYZwiA=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions TikTok Page\"\n                /></a>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n                <p style=\"font-size: 14px !important; color: #fff\">\n                  <small>\n                    Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                    Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                    Philippines 4000<br />\n                    <br />\n                    You are receiving this email because you opted in at our\n                    website. <br />\n                  </small>\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>', 1, '3a34b34341be96bcb31dfe6ad1b14510949ffc9c561bb8d3cafbc7ed503e7fdd', 'Louren Isobel', 'developer', '', '', '11', 'louren.rubico@frontlinebusiness.com.ph', '', '2025-06-24 07:55:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
