 audit, you\'ll discover:</p>\n              <table class=\"table-list\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/13_jZq2Hey6SDjJQGq-MRCs_RNZ93pMgp\"\n                        width=\"16\"\n                        alt=\"Check Icon Image\"\n                        style=\"\n                          display: inline-block;\n                          vertical-align: middle;\n                          margin-right: 10px;\n                        \"\n                      />\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\">\n                    What\'s slowing your site down\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/13_jZq2Hey6SDjJQGq-MRCs_RNZ93pMgp\"\n                        width=\"16\"\n                        alt=\"Check Icon Image\"\n                        style=\"\n                          display: inline-block;\n                          vertical-align: middle;\n                          margin-right: 10px;\n                        \"\n                      />\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\">\n                    Where users might be dropping off\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/13_jZq2Hey6SDjJQGq-MRCs_RNZ93pMgp\"\n      