style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #333\">\n                    marketing@frontlinebusiness.com.ph\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- FOOTER -->\n            <div\n              class=\"footer\"\n              style=\"padding: 32px 24px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n            >\n              <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none; cursor: none\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                  alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Logo\"\n                  style=\"\n                    width: 200px;\n                    display: block;\n                    margin-left: auto;\n                    margin-right: auto;\n                  \"\n                />\n              </a>\n              <h3\n                style=\"\n                  color: #fff;\n                  text-align: center;\n                  margin: 16px 0;\n                  line-height: 1.2;\n                \"\n              >\n                Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n                in Managed Services\n              </h3>\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  color: #fff;\n                  text-align: center;\n                  font-size: 12px !important;\n                  margin-bottom: 16px;\n                  line-height: 1.2;\n                \"\n              >\n                We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n                <br />\n                web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n                development.\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Facebook Page\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions LinkedIn Page\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions YouTube Channel\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontline.business/\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPsABBWthmMwhMnRaz0NxOwLNe_F5dyau9JBbQUAbT48kN5S7WKa1_M6SSb6awE4kFyDiIKv7prYY2wCPNfYegju-Ph0xjM9khTrzBbAb0eY8AUwA=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions Instagram Page\"\n                /></a>\n                <a\n                  href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@frontlinebusinessinc\"\n                  style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                  ><img\n                    style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNF50VT3hd-2PhvM_OUWALWmBgwrHp3drnQM-wGSSP5-C-RHXP-HePnxs4W-f8dDzun14Jth78npNTahLoR-9snETM5vsIPBBvdXzJfqPS8-eYZwiA=s70-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"Frontline Business Solutions TikTok Page\"\n                /></a>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n                <p style=\"font-size: 14px !important; color: #fff\">\n                  <small>\n                    Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                    Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                    Philippines 4000<br />\n                    <br />\n                    You are receiving this email because you opted in at our\n                    website. <br />\n                  </small>\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>', 1, '3a34b34341be96bcb31dfe6ad1b14510949ffc9c561bb8d3cafbc7ed503e7fdd', 'Louren Isobel', 'developer', '', '', '11', 'louren.rubico@frontlinebusiness.com.ph', '', '2025-06-27 09:27:44', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(70, 1, 17, 'louren.rubico@frontlinebusiness.com.ph', 'This is sample email with file', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\" />\n    <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark only\" />\n    <title>You Didn\'t Click — But We Did It Anyway</title>\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n      }\n      * {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n      }\n      body {\n        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n        color: #333;\n        overflow-x: hidden;\n        background-color: #ffffff;\n      }\n      p,\n      ul li {\n        font-size: 16px !important;\n      }\n      .container {\n        max-width: 700px;\n        width: 100% !important;\n        margin: 0 auto !important;\n        padding: 0 !important;\n        background-color: #ffffff !important;\n      }\n      .canvas {\n        width: 700px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        background-color: #ffffff !important;\n      }\n      .section-block {\n        padding: 32px !important;\n      }\n      @media screen and (min-width: 340px) and (max-width: 520px) {\n        .canvas {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          background-color: white !important;\n        }\n        p,\n        ul li {\n          font-size: 16px !important;\n        }\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div style=\"background-color: #ffffff !important; width: 100% !important\">\n      <div style=\"background-color: #dddddd !important; padding: 0\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"canvas\">\n            <!-- BANNER/HERO IMAGE -->\n            <div>\n              <a href=\"#\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1-RDxX1kp15r58_hjt2fxcwwQLEiZA1Ms\"\n                  alt=\"Still Haven\'t Claimed Your Website Audit?\nHERE\'S YOUR FREE AUDIT\"\n                  style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\"\n              /></a>\n            </div>\n            <!-- INTRODUCTION -->\n            <div class=\"section-block\">\n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">Hi there,</p>\n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\n                You might\'ve missed our first message — and that\'s okay. But\n                your website? It\'s missing opportunities you shouldn\'t be.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                So we took the initiative and ran a FREE Website Audit for you —\n                no forms, no pressure, just honest, expert insights.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n            <!-- OUTLINE -->\n            <div class=\"section-block\" style=\"background-color: #f2f2f2\">\n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\n                And we packaged all of it into a free, easy-to-understand report\n                — just for you.\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\n                <strong>HERE IT IS:</strong>\n              </p>\n              <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\n                <p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center\">\n                  <strong>Mobile Performance</strong>\n                </p>\n                <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1qyYlqvTM_r-_GPVkXHRHMIo9WTRwUUiB\"\n                    width=\"100%\"\n                    alt=\"mobile-result\"\n                    style=\"\n                      display: inline-block;\n                      vertical-align: middle;\n                      margin-right: 6px;\n                    \"\n                  />\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\n                <p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center\">\n                  <strong>Desktop Performance</strong>\n                </p>\n                <a href=\"#\" style=\"pointer-events: none\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1-2pp1Fh-_q5caUJu6awGvS1EozPM4G8d\"\n                    width=\"100%\"\n                    alt=\"desktop-result\"\n                    style=\"\n                      display: inline-block;\n                      vertical-align: middle;\n                      margin-right: 6px;\n                    \"\n                  />\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- SCHEDULE -->\n            <div class=\"section-block\">\n              <p style=\"margin: 0px auto 20px; text-align: left\">\n                If you\'re serious about growing online and attracting more\n                leads, this audit could be the small shift that drives big\n                results. We can help you <strong>OPTIMIZE</strong> and\n                <strong>REDESIGN</strong>\n                your website to <strong>CONVERT</strong> and build a strong\n                <strong>ONLINE PRESENCE</strong>.\n              </p>\n              <p\n                style=\"\n                  margin: 0px auto 20px;\n                  text-align: center;\n\n                  max-width: 430px;\n                \"\n              >\n                Book a FREE Consultation-Discovery Call here.\n              </p>\n              <table\n                class=\"table-list\"\n                cellpadding=\"0\"\n                cellspacing=\"0\"\n                style=\"margin: 0 auto\"\n              >\n                <tr>\n                  <td>\n                    <img\n                      width=\"40px\"\n                      style=\"display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1pR5jOHgHDvpCe-orhIXvh38KVk8j3vqV\"\n                      alt=\"Thumbs-left Icon Image\"\n                    />\n                  </td>\n                  <td>\n                    <div style=\"text-align: center\">\n                      <a\n                        class=\"btn\"\n                        href=\"https://calendly.com/frontlinebusiness-marketing/30min\"\n                        style=\"\n                          display: inline-block;\n                          color: #dbd5d5;\n                          font-weight: 300;\n                          padding: 15px 20px;\n                          background-color: #f5c400;\n                          color: #ad0a64;\n                          border-radius: 10px;\n                          text-decoration: none;\n                          font-size: 18px;\n                          font-weight: 600;\n                        \"\n                        >BOOK A FREE CONSULTATION</a\n                      >\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n            <!-- CONTACT -->\n            <div class=\"section-block\">\n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\n                Let\'s turn clicks into customers. Ready?\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">To your growth,</p>\n\n              <div class=\"contact\" style=\"text-align: center\">\n                <a href=\"#\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNwbQuBMk5tk4sfEm6VpS_hHUtX2YqJfo1lexFxVQyMRSdZw7haeU3hnKl3SZobWFAGS6QlDM_EHqI4lwrrSa5yp3qFouXtcXUbU2r8jq9wd1jVvLU=s116-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"sir-carlo\"\n                    style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; width: 70px\"\n                  />\n                </a>\n                <div>\n                  <p style=\"font-weight: 600\">Carlo Del Monte</p>\n                  <p>Marketing Head</p>\n           